      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "{\"actor\":\"the agency\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(I) that the agency may make one request to the requester for information and toll the 20-day period while it is awaiting such information that it has reasonably requested from the requester under this section; or\",\"(II) if necessary to clarify with the requester issues regarding fee assessment. In either case, the agency’s receipt of the requester’s response to the agency’s request for information or clarification ends the tolling period.\"],\"choice_text\":\"Tolling is prohibited except under one of two alternative circumstances: (I) awaiting reasonably requested information from one request made to the requester under this section; or (II) if necessary to clarify fee assessment issues with the requester.\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"summary\":\"The 20-day period shall not be tolled by the agency except: (I) the agency may make one request to the requester for information and toll the 20-day period while it is awaiting such information that it has reasonably requested from the requester under section 552; or (II) if necessary to clarify with the requester issues regarding fee assessment.\"}",
